 ([Cr(L)₆]³⁺, cm⁻¹)\"","\u0027Si Δo \u003e P, el complejo es…\u0027":"\"If Δo \u003e P, the complex is…\"","\u0027Simulador 3D · química inorgánica\u0027":"\"3D Simulator · inorganic chemistry\"","\u0027Sube P por encima de Δo: vuelve a alto espín.\u0027":"\u0027Raise P above Δo: it goes back to high spin.\u0027","\u0027t₂g solamente\u0027":"\"t₂g only\"","\u0027t₂g⁶: todos apareados.\u0027":"\"t₂g⁶: all paired.\"","\u0027tetraédrico\u0027":"\"tetrahedral\"","\u0027Un ligando π-aceptor (CO) produce…\u0027":"\"A π-acceptor ligand (CO) produces…\"","\u0027Un ligando π-donor (Cl⁻) hace que Δo…\u0027":"\"A π-donor ligand (Cl⁻) makes Δo…\"","\u0027Un par por ligando.\u0027":"\"One pair per ligand.\"","\u0027vacíos\u0027":"\"empty\"","\u0027verde\u0027":"\"green\"","\u0027violeta\u0027":"\"violet\"","\u0027Volver a la lección\u0027":"\"Back to the lesson\"","\u0027Δo \u0026gt; P ⇒ bajo espín.\u0027":"\"Δo \u0026gt; P ⇒ low spin.\"","\u0027Δo \u0026gt; P: bajo espín\u0027":"\"Δo \u0026gt; P: low spin\"","\u0027Δo \u0026lt; P: alto espín\u0027":"\"Δo \u0026lt; P: high spin\"","\u0027Δo \u003c P → alto espín · Δo \u003e P → bajo espín (d⁴ a d⁷)\u0027":"\"Δo \u003c P → high spin · Δo \u003e P → low spin (d⁴ to d⁷)\"","\u0027Δo frente a P\u0027":"\"Δo versus P\"","\u0027Δo grande\u0027":"\"a large Δo\"","\u0027Δo igual\u0027":"\"the same Δo\"","\u0027Δo pequeño\u0027":"\"a small Δo\"","\u0027λ = 10⁷/20 000 = 500 nm.\u0027":"\"λ = 10⁷/20,000 = 500 nm.\"","\u0027λ = 10⁷/Δo; color = complementario.\u0027":"\"λ = 10⁷/Δo; color = complementary.\"","\u0027λ absorbida\u0027":"\"λ absorbed\"","\u0027λ absorbida = 10⁷/Δo (nm) · color observado = complementario\u0027":"\"λ absorbed = 10⁷/Δo (nm) · observed color = complementary\"","\u0027π-aceptor\u0027":"\"π-acceptor\"","\u0027π-aceptor fuerte\u0027":"\"strong π-acceptor\"","\u0027π-aceptores\u0027":"\"π-acceptors\"","\u0027π-donor\u0027":"\"π-donor\"","\u0027π-donor ⇒ Δo menor; π-aceptor ⇒ Δo mayor.\u0027":"\"π-donor ⇒ smaller Δo; π-a